  "description": "YUFZIM crystallizes in the orthorhombic crystal system with space group P n m a. Reported CIF formula moiety: C36 H40 Cr1 Dy3 N6 O22 2+,2(Cl1 1-),5(H2 O1). From the CIF bond table, Dy1 (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Dy2 (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Cr3 (Cr) has 6 O neighbors; Dy3 (Dy) has 8 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 6 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.380-3.820 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 101.53-107.88°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [CrIIIDyIII3(OH)4(iso)6(H2O)6]Cl2·5H2O. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 4 OH (explicit grouped unit in article formula), 6 H2O (explicit grouped unit in article formula).",
